[SIZE=6][B][DD] - Core Library v1.4.3[/B][/SIZE]

The essential core framework required for all [B]cv6 / Dice Dragons[/B] add-ons.

[HEADING=2]Features[/HEADING]
[LIST]
[*][B]FontAwesome Icon Auto-Completion[/B]: Interactive autocomplete dropdown (`fa-` + 2 characters) with live SVG mask previews inheriting current text color (`currentColor`), smooth transitions, and full modifier class support (`fas`, `fa-spin`, `fa-rotate-90`).
[*][B]FontAwesome Icon Chooser[/B]: Pre-built template menu for FontAwesome icon selection.
[*][B]Asset Uploader[/B]: Standardized upload template with live image preview.
[*][B]Icon Helper & Validation[/B]: Backend filesystem indexing (`cv6\Core\Helper\Icon`) and robust option verifiers (`verifyValidIconMandatory` & `verifyValidIconOptional`).
[/LIST]

[HEADING=2]Requirements[/HEADING]
[LIST]
[*]XenForo 2.3.0+
[*]PHP 8.2.0+
[/LIST]
